<title>SWEDEN: Sydkraft posts flat 9-mo profit after fin items.</title>
<headline>Sydkraft posts flat 9-mo profit after fin items.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1996-11-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nine months to September 30:</p>
<p>					(million crowns unless stated)</p>
<p> Profit after fin items		1,680   vs  1,684</p>
<p> Sales				     9,677   vs  8,649</p>
<p> Shr (crowns)			     6.29   vs   6.33</p>
<p> Depreciation				973   vs    952</p>
<p> Operating profit			2,304   vs  2,464</p>
<p> Operating costs			 6,400   vs  5,233</p>
<p> Net financial items	   CHARGE  710   vs    824 CHARGE</p>
<p> Minorities			CHARGE   13   vs	8 CHARGE</p>
<p> Interest in associates		   86   vs     44</p>
<p> Tax					   465   vs    467</p>
<p>NOTE -- Sydkraft AB is a Swedish power producer.</p>
<p>-- Stockholm newsroom +46-8-7001017</p>
</text>
